{
  "format": 1,
  "package": "sgd",
  "profile": "sgd-gdd-29.338-ordinary-slice-v1",
  "version": "0.1.0-slice.15",
  "sources": [
    "3GPP TS 29.338 V18.2.0 sections 6.2, 6.3 and 7: ordinary IMSI MO / MME or SGSN MT subset; SGd and Gdd share application 16777313",
    "3GPP TS 29.272 location groups and 23.003 PLMN/ECGI/TAI encoding as audited in doc/diameterkit-mainflow-audit.md section 13.3",
    "manual rules revision 2: prior ordinary SMS rules plus TFR 3330 requires3332; TFA3331 only10415/5550 and original3330; raw Time zero preserved",
    "manual relation revision 2: original MME/SGSN target, direct terminal role and same-PLMN evidence; explicit eras and power-saving facts; strict-before send, equal receive NeedsApplication; no Router token or application retry",
    "generator9 / ops8: SGDRetransmission for TFR/TFA and T4Charging for OFR/OFA; ordinary MO zero-context retained, independent E and Canonical; TransportReplay not audited",
    "TS29.338 V18.2.0 table6.3.3.1/2 overrides External-Identifier toM0; TS29.337 V18.0.0 T4 MO and SCTP; TS29.336 6.4.11, fixed23.003/RFC4282 ASCII escaped NAI subset",
    "manual rules/context revision3: top-level OFA3111 UTF8; T4Charging bounded original IMSI/MSISDN/SC and endpoint binding, required charging identity and optional exact external mapping; no mapping service or native T4 commands",
    "manual rules/context revision4: TS29.338 V18.2.0 section7.3.2 OFA experimental10415/5001 only SGd SMS-IWMSC and original MSISDN; MOForwarding explicit interface/sender/SC/endpoints, Gdd/T4 unsupported report, zero-context NeedsApplication; base5001/E independent",
    "manual IMS MO revision5: TS29.338 V18.2.0 table6.2.1.1/1-2,6.2.1.2,5.3.3.18-20,6.3.3.13-16; IMS OFR no-IMSI/no-MSISDN source uses15zero dummy, required3324 contains3325 HSSID UTF8 and3326/3327 URI, required3316/3320 cause0/1 and optional cause1 diagnostic11/12. Explicit IMSMOForwarding binds IP-SM-GW/IWMSC, HSSID, URI digest, SC; normal experimental5001 and T4 External-Identifier not selected. No delivery history, MWD, persistence, automatic retry or transport replay; generator9/ops8 unchanged",
    "manual IMS MT revision6: TS29.338 V18.2.0 table6.2.2.1/1-2 and6.3.3.13-16; TFR top UserName HSSID6..15 with dedicated3324/3326/3327 UTF8 V1M0, no nestedHSSID or MME/SGSN number. Explicit IMSMTForwarding binds GMSC/IP-SM-GW, HSSID/SC and domain-separated URI digest. Selected TFA2001/base errors/5552/5555cause0..2/E; access-node results/diagnostics/location and3330/3331/3332 not selected. Timer/Start/flags retained, no clock inference, retry scheduling or TransportReplay; generator9/ops8 unchanged",
    "manual IMS MO identity revision7: TS29.338 V18.2.0 table6.2.1.1/1; known originatingIMSI plus optional actualMSISDN, no dummy withIMSI. IMSMOForwarding SenderIMSI/SenderMSISDN optional evidence binds exact source identities and presence; absent both retains prior noIMSI/dummy branch. Reuse inactive source slots, no Context size or budget growth, no new purpose kind. IMS5001/T4ExternalIdentifier remain unselected even with realMSISDN; no subscriber lookup, automatic forwarding or replay; generator9/ops8 unchanged",
    "manual Router MT revision8: TS29.338 V18.2.0 table6.2.2.1/1-2 and6.2.2.3; dedicated TFA UserIdentifier/AlertUserIdentifier required UserName token UTF8/noNUL1..256 byte local subset, no MSISDN/ExternalID/LMSI. Selected token only on5550with3331; Router context requires token with3331. Explicit RetransmissionToRouter, optional-known RouterAlertSupported requiredtrue with3330 alongside SamePLMN. TFR zero accessnumbers wire-possible only completes with Router context; direct MME/SGSN still requires appropriate number. Original3330/GMSCaddress/PowerSaving/explicitera andstrict-before/equalreceiveNeedsApplication unchanged. No token store/generation, proxy forwarding or automatic retry; generator13/ops8 unchanged."
  ],
